---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy | NFTropoly">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
    <p class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-500 tracking-widest">LEGAL</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mt-2 mb-4">Privacy</h1>
    <p>
      Accounts and sign-in for NFTropoly run on World of Unreal Identity and are governed by the
      canonical policy at <a class="underline" href="https://worldofunreal.com/privacy">worldofunreal.com/privacy</a>
      (Controller: World of Unreal · Contact: privacy@worldofunreal.com). This page only adds NFTropoly specifics.
    </p>
    <h2 class="text-white font-bold mt-6 mb-2">NFTropoly specifics</h2>
    <p>
      Collections, trades, and vault positions are gameplay records tied to your identity and partly
      on-chain: connected wallet addresses and completed trades are public by nature.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4">Rights and deletion: <a class="underline" href="mailto:privacy@worldofunreal.com">privacy@worldofunreal.com</a> — replies within 45 days.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
